Support Type: Community Wallet; Browser Extension; Mobile; dApp Connector (CIP-30); NFT/DeFi Focus
Status: Live
Sources: (HIGH) [GeroWallet Website, https://gerowallet.io/]; (MEDIUM) [GeroWallet GitHub, https://github.com/gerowallet]

Wallet: Lace / Daedalus / Yoroi / Eternl / Vespr / Typhon / Nami / Flint / GeroWallet — all support CIP-30 (dApp Connector Standard) and CIP-1852 (HD Wallet Derivation Path)
Status: Live
Sources: (HIGH) [CIP-30 Spec, https://cips.cardano.org/cips/cip30/]; (HIGH) [CIP-1852 Spec, https://cips.cardano.org/cips/cip1852/]

## Developer Ecosystem

SDK: MeshJS
Description: TypeScript/JavaScript framework for dApp development — wallet connection (CIP-30, WalletConnect), transaction building, Plutus script interaction, off-chain code, React hooks
Repository: https://github.com/MeshJS/mesh
Sources: (HIGH) [MeshJS Website, https://meshjs.dev/]; (HIGH) [MeshJS Docs, https://meshjs.dev/docs/]

SDK: Lucid
Description: TypeScript/Deno library for transaction building, Plutus script interaction, wallet connection, and off-chain logic — functional programming style
Repository: https://github.com/spacebudz/lucid
Sources: (HIGH) [Lucid GitHub, https://github.com/spacebudz/lucid]; (HIGH) [Lucid Docs, https://lucid.spacebudz.io/]

SDK: Cardano Serialization Library (CSL)
Description: Rust/WASM/JS bindings for low-level transaction serialization, cryptographic operations, address/key derivation — foundation for all wallets and SDKs
Repository: https://github.com/Emurgo/cardano-serialization-lib
Sources: (HIGH) [CSL GitHub, https://github.com/Emurgo/cardano-serialization-lib]; (HIGH) [CSL Docs, https://emurgo.github.io/cardano-serialization-lib/]

SDK: Aiken
Description: ML-inspired smart contract language + toolchain (compiler, LSP, package manager, testing, formatting) targeting Plutus Core
Repository: https://github.com/aiken-lang/aiken
Sources: (HIGH) [Aiken Website, https://aiken-lang.org/]; (HIGH) [Aiken GitHub, https://github.com/aiken-lang/aiken]

SDK: Plutarch
Description: Haskell-embedded Plutus Core compiler with type-level guarantees for on-chain validation scripts
Repository: https://github.com/Plutarch/Plutarch
Sources: (HIGH) [Plutarch GitHub, https://github.com/Plutarch/Plutarch]; (MEDIUM) [Plutarch Docs, https://plutarch.dev/]

SDK: Helios
Description: JavaScript-like language for Plutus Core, browser-based IDE, compiler, testing framework — zero-setup web development
Repository: https://github.com/Hyperion-BT/helios
Sources: (HIGH) [Helios Website, https://helios-lang.io/]; (HIGH) [Helios GitHub, https://github.com/Hyperion-BT/helios]

API: Blockfrost API
Description: REST API, WebSocket, IPFS Gateway for Cardano mainnet/preprod/preview — UTxO, addresses, stakes, scripts, metadata, governance, treasury endpoints
Documentation: https://docs.blockfrost.io/
Sources: (HIGH) [Blockfrost Docs, https://docs.blockfrost.io/]

API: Koios API
